---
description: SCL design system — tokens, typography, components, motion
globs: src/app/**/*.tsx,src/components/**/*.tsx,src/app/**/*.css
---

Follow `docs/SCL_DESIGN_CONTRACT.md` and `docs/SCL_COMPONENT_SYSTEM.md`.

- **Tokens only** (defined in `src/app/globals.css`). Every color has a job:
  `bg-background/card/surface-2/surface-3` (depth), `border`/`border-strong`, `brand` (indigo
  identity/CTAs), `pos` (green = wins/+units/+ROI), `neg` (red = losses/−), `gold` (rank/elite/
  trophies), `live` (cyan = live/verification), `muted-foreground` (secondary). Never raw hex or
  Tailwind palette colors (no `zinc-900`).
- **Numbers are the product:** use `tabular-nums` / `.nums`, sign-tone signed stats (pos/neg),
  uppercase tracked labels, big bold values. Derive display strings via `src/lib/format.ts`.
- **Build from SCL components** (`src/components/scl/*`): StatBlock/StatPill, Roi/Unit/WinRate/
  Record stats, VerificationBadge, TrophyBadge, SportTag, StatusBadge, RankMovementIndicator,
  RecentFormStrip, CapperAvatar, LeaderboardRow/MobileCard, CapperCard, PickCard, SectionHeader,
  EmptyState, Skeleton*. Add new shared components here and document them.
- **shadcn = Base UI:** polymorphism is `render` (e.g. `<Button render={<Link href="/x" />}>`),
  never `asChild`. Add primitives via `npx shadcn@latest add`.
- **Mobile-first:** tables get a real mobile card variant (`hidden md:block` / `md:hidden`),
  tap targets ≥ 40px, no overflow at 375px.
- **States always:** loading (Skeleton*), empty (EmptyState), error (inline + toast).
- **Motion** (`motion`) is subtle + meaningful only (rank/live/status/filter/reveal/trophy/
  skeleton); respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. No decorative or readability-harming effects.
- Don't produce a default-shadcn/SaaS look — it must feel like SCL.
